  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Harmonised Protection Monitoring to inform and influence policy making</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FCDO will be supporting the continued development, consolidation, and expansion of a UNHCR led interagency protection monitoring system, Project 21. The protection monitoring system will harmonise protection data and lead a joint analysis of protection trends. The data and protection analysis will be linked with existing data collection initiatives in other sectors and widely disseminated amongst actors and decision-makers of various sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
